      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REPELLING (6) was successful last time out by 1.4 metres in a solid performance at Port Pirie over 1609m. Recent effort is good enough to win a race of this calibre. FE FE ON FIRE (2) failed to flatter last time out when fifth, beaten 30 metres, over 2070m at Gawler. Form prior to that was far better, including a sound second over 1800m at this track two starts ago. Has the benefit of a good draw and is capable of running a much better race. CEE CEE LOU (11) is open to further improvement at the third run back from a spell after saluting last time out over 2190m at Shepparton. Likely to be around the mark again. IM ALL BUSINESS (7) is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish second here over 2230m. One for the multiples.",
